  <WeazelGene_WeazelSyndrome.labelShortAdj>鼬族症候</WeazelGene_WeazelSyndrome.labelShortAdj>
  <!-- EN: Carriers feel pure euphoria from Essence extraction and live only for the next one. -->
  <WeazelGene_WeazelSyndrome.description>带有此基因者会从抽取精华中感受到纯粹的狂喜，活着只为了下一次抽取。</WeazelGene_WeazelSyndrome.description>
