  <!-- EN: Essence Domestication: Accelerated Breeding -->
  <WeazelGene_E_Cattle_Horny.label>精华家畜化：加速繁殖</WeazelGene_E_Cattle_Horny.label>
  <!-- EN: Essence-livestock -->
  <WeazelGene_E_Cattle_Horny.labelShortAdj>精华家畜</WeazelGene_E_Cattle_Horny.labelShortAdj>
  <!-- EN: The Weazels had completely lost it. There were countless uses for Essence, and nowhere near enough of it to go around.\nThen, a brilliant Weazel created this gene.\nIf they needed to extract more Essence, they would simply breed more of the livestock it could be extracted from. -->
  <WeazelGene_E_Cattle_Horny.description>鼬族们彻底崩溃了。需要用到精华的地方多不胜数，精华却远远不够分。\n就在这时，一名天才鼬族创造了这个基因。\n既然需要抽取更多精华，那就繁殖更多能被抽取的家畜就好了。</WeazelGene_E_Cattle_Horny.description>
  <!-- EN: still -->
